BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Unclickable
DTSTART:20250522T203000Z
DTEND:20250522T215500Z
DTSTAMP:20250522T203000Z
UID:BgO3F9ZZdK
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 74 mins (1h14m)\n\nIn this investigative documentary
  ripped from the headlines\, follow the creation and devastating impact of
  a digital advertising fraud operation\, the likes of which enriches compa
 nies like Google and Facebook at the cost of everybody else…and democrac
 y itself. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/unclickable\n\nFi
 lm is also being streamed.
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer's Camera
DTSTART:20250522T223000Z
DTEND:20250523T000500Z
DTSTAMP:20250522T223000Z
UID:YZA7nM6UfX
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 82 mins (1h22m)\n\nA high school girl\, still reelin
 g over the death of her father\, develops the last of his film\, only to u
 ncover an intimate secret he kept from her in Divine Sung’s heartfelt an
 d gorgeously shot coming-of-age feature debut about first loves. Director/
 Screenwriter Divine Sung scheduled to attend. Young Creators Spotlight: Co
 me early to the May 21 screening to meet teen advisory boardmembers from Y
 outh in Focus\, who will be sharing postcards\, stickers\, and information
  about their photography summer camp. This film is generously sponsored by
  David Prokopy. Also sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/summer
 s-camera\n\nFilm is also being streamed.
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bitter Gold
DTSTART:20250523T010000Z
DTEND:20250523T023500Z
DTSTAMP:20250523T010000Z
UID:QQSkMS8aL7
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 83 mins (1h23m)\n\nIn this pulse-pounding neo-wester
 n thriller set in the cutthroat artisanal mining industry in the deserts o
 f northern Chile\, 16-year-old Carola must take control of the family busi
 ness and stave off greedy\, gold-seeking rivals after her father gets seri
 ously injured.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/bitter-gold
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Beginnings
DTSTART:20250523T033000Z
DTEND:20250523T052000Z
DTSTAMP:20250523T033000Z
UID:HyPR7W5Tdp
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 96 mins (1h36m)\n\nLife is full of unexpected twists
 . Ane and Thomas (Trine Dyrholm and David Dencik at the top of their craft
 ) must redefine the parameters of their relationship when\, just as they a
 re about to finalize their divorce and tell their two daughters\, she suff
 ers a stroke. Producer Eva Jakobsen and cast Bjørk Storm scheduled to att
 end. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/beginnings\n\nAlso pla
 ying at:\n  • SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2 (Fri 23 May\, 3:00 PM)
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
