BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Twinless
DTSTART:20250526T021500Z
DTEND:20250526T040500Z
DTSTAMP:20250526T021500Z
UID:Ehq0cT1VhE
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 100 mins (1h40m)\n\nIn this Portland-set dark comedy
  from James Sweeney (2019’s crowdpleasing Straight Up)\, two men (Dylan 
 O’Brien and Sweeney) trauma-bond at a support group for people who have 
 lost their twin. Winner of the Sundance 2025 US Dramatic Audience Award. D
 irector James Sweeney scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festiv
 al/twinless\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1 (Sat 24 
 May\, 12:30 PM)
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
